* Rewrite the definition of a bus to distinguish an interface, protocol, shared bus, point-to-point connection, and switched interconnect.
* Replace the universal burst definition with separate AHB and AXI examples; state that AHB presents address/control for every beat while AXI normally presents one burst address followed by multiple data beats.
